# Admin 목록 테이블·버튼 갭 (어댑터)

**수치:** 공유 SSOT → [list-table-shell.mdc](../../../../.cursor/rules/cms-admin-ui/list-table-shell.mdc)

## Admin path · 토큰

| CSS 변수 | 값 (shell과 동일) |
|----------|-------------------|
| `--admin-list-card-padding` | 20px |
| `--admin-list-card-radius` | 12px |
| `--admin-list-toolbar-to-table-gap` | 16px |
| `--admin-list-title-desc-gap` | 10px |
| `--admin-list-toolbar-actions-gap` | 8px |

정의: [`list-table-layout.css`](../../../src/shared/ui/list-table-layout.css)  
라벨·액션: [`table-header-label.css`](../../../src/shared/ui/table-header-label.css)

## 마크업

```tsx
<div className="admin-list-card">
  <div className="admin-list-toolbar">
    <div className="table-header-title--wrapper">
      <span className="table-title">… 목록</span>
      <span className="table-description">총 N건</span>
    </div>
    <div className="table-header-actions--wrapper">{/* CmsButton */}</div>
  </div>
  {/* table */}
</div>
```

